  "content": "<div>日本公务员面试辅导网站 <a href=\"https://mensetsu-gokaku.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://mensetsu-gokaku.net/</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/4id5orhfnr_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>看流量增长数据，从6月几乎没流量，到11月的68万访问量。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/4id5orhfnr_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>只有日本流量，58%来自于自然搜索。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/4id5orhfnr_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>主要靠内容获取流量</div>\n<div>可以用 <a href=\"https://detailed.com/extension/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://detailed.com/extension/</a> 分析一下这个网站的结构 <a href=\"https://mensetsu-gokaku.net/shakai/20180702-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://mensetsu-gokaku.net/shakai/20180702-3.html</a></div>\n<div>这两篇是9月份在生财的航海中图文直播分享过的内容，后来放到公众号付费文章里了，我刚刚搞了个临时链接，发给大家复习一下基础知识。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/4id5orhfnr_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>能力不错</div>",
